ormance Optical Distribution for FTTH Networks</h3><p><br></p><p>The ZTI 1×16 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter is a premium-quality passive optical device designed to evenly distribute a single optical signal into sixteen balanced outputs. Built using advanced Planar Lightwave Circuit (PLC) technology, this splitter ensures stable optical performance, low insertion loss, and excellent wavelength uniformity—making it ideal for FTTH, FTTX, GPON, EPON, and PON networks across Bangladesh.</p><p><br></p><p>Engineered for long-term network reliability, the ZTI 1×16 PLC Splitter supports a broad wavelength range of 1260–1650nm, ensuring seamless compatibility with modern fiber networks. Whether used in distribution boxes, ODF frames, or outdoor enclosures, this splitter delivers dependable performance in demanding environments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>1×16 splitting ratio for large-scale FTTH distribution</li><li>High-precision PLC chip ensures uniform and stable optical output</li><li>Low insertion loss &amp; high return loss for superior signal quality</li><li>Wide wavelength support (1260–1650nm) for GPON/EPON systems</li><li>Durable &amp; compact construction for indoor/outdoor installation</li><li>Connector options: SC/UPC, SC/APC, LC/UPC, LC/APC (as required)</li><li>Stable performance under extreme temperatures</li><li>Perfect for ISPs, telecom companies &amp; enterprise fiber networks</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"ZTI 1×4 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%974-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"180৳","old":"200৳","single":""},{"name":"ZTI 1×2 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%972-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"140৳","old":"150৳","single":""},{"name":"ZTI 1×8 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%978-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"","old":"","single":"210৳"}]},{"title":"Vide